  "locale": {
    "id": {
      "judul": "Jadikan Prosedur",
      "instruksi": "Cari bagian yang muncul berulang di program, lalu pilih prosedur yang paling tepat untuk mewakilinya.",
      "pilihan": "pilihan",
      "c1": "maju, maju, kanan, ambil bola",
      "c2": "maju, maju",
      "c3": "ambil bola, maju",
      "q1": "Program: maju, maju, kanan, ambil bola, maju, maju, kanan, ambil bola, maju, maju, kanan, ambil bola. Bagian mana yang paling cocok dijadikan prosedur?",
      "c4": "tepuk, tepuk, putar, lompat",
      "c5": "putar, lompat, tepuk",
      "c6": "tepuk",
      "q2": "Tarian: tepuk, tepuk, putar, lompat, tepuk, tepuk, putar, lompat. Bagian mana yang dibuat jadi prosedur?",
      "c7": "persegi(): ulangi 4: maju 3, kanan",
      "c8": "geser()",
      "c9": "kanan()",
      "q3": "Gambar: (maju 3, kanan) ×4 lalu geser; (maju 3, kanan) ×4 lalu geser; (maju 3, kanan) ×4. Prosedur apa yang paling berguna?",
      "c10": "mulai_ulang(): skor = 0, nyawa = 3, ke awal",
      "c11": "skor_nol(): skor = 0",
      "c12": "level_tiga()",
      "q4": "Game: setiap kali nyawa habis → skor = 0, nyawa = 3, robot ke petak awal. Ini terjadi di 3 level. Prosedur apa yang sebaiknya dibuat?",
      "c13": "satu_pot(): maju 2, siram",
      "c14": "pulang()",
      "c15": "siram(), pulang()",
      "q5": "Robot penyiram: maju 2, siram, maju 2, siram, maju 2, siram, pulang. Prosedur mana yang paling pas?",
      "c16": "ditulis sekali, dipakai berkali-kali",
      "c17": "supaya programnya lebih panjang",
      "c18": "supaya komputer tidak perlu perintah",
      "q6": "Mengapa bagian yang sering diulang dibuat jadi prosedur?",
      "c19": "ucapkan(nama): tampil nama, 'Selamat!', terompet",
      "c20": "lima_teman()",
      "c21": "terompet()",
      "q7": "Program salam ulang tahun: tampil nama, tampil 'Selamat!', tiup terompet. Ini dipakai untuk 5 teman berbeda. Prosedur yang baik adalah…",
      "c22": "ulangi 6 kali: tangga()",
      "c23": "tangga() saja",
      "c24": "maju 6, naik 6",
      "q8": "Prosedur tangga() = maju 1, naik 1. Bangunan butuh 6 anak tangga. Program terpendek adalah…",
      "c25": "siku(n): maju n, kanan, maju n",
      "c26": "siku3() dan siku5()",
      "q9": "Dua bagian kode ini sama kecuali angkanya: (maju 3, kanan, maju 3) dan (maju 5, kanan, maju 5). Prosedur yang paling berguna adalah…",
      "c27": "cuci_tangan()",
      "c28": "makan, main",
      "c29": "tidur()",
      "q10": "Program: cuci tangan, makan, cuci tangan, main, cuci tangan, tidur. Bagian mana yang cocok jadi prosedur?",
      "c30": "buat fungsi diskon(harga)",
      "c31": "tulis ulang di tiap halaman",
      "c32": "hapus diskonnya",
      "q11": "Kalkulator diskon dipakai di 6 halaman toko daring: harga_baru = harga - harga * 10 / 100. Sebaiknya…",
      "c33": "ulangi 10 kali: lampu_kedip()",
      "c34": "lampu_kedip() 1 kali",
      "c35": "nyala, mati ×10 tanpa tunggu",
      "q12": "Prosedur lampu_kedip(): nyala, tunggu 1 detik, mati, tunggu 1 detik. Untuk 10 kedipan, program terbaik adalah…"
    },
    "en": {
      "judul": "Make It a Procedure",
      "instruksi": "Find the part that repeats in the program, then choose the best procedure to stand for it.",
      "pilihan": "choices",
      "c1": "forward, forward, right, pick up ball",
      "c2": "forward, forward",
      "c3": "pick up ball, forward",
      "q1": "Program: forward, forward, right, pick up ball, forward, forward, right, pick up ball, forward, forward, right, pick up ball. Which part is best made into a procedure?",
      "c4": "clap, clap, spin, jump",
      "c5": "spin, jump, clap",
      "c6": "clap",
      "q2": "Dance: clap, clap, spin, jump, clap, clap, spin, jump. Which part becomes a procedure?",
      "c7": "square(): repeat 4: forward 3, right",
      "c8": "move()",
      "c9": "right()",
      "q3": "Drawing: (forward 3, right) ×4 then move; (forward 3, right) ×4 then move; (forward 3, right) ×4. Which procedure is most useful?",
      "c10": "restart(): score = 0, lives = 3, go to start",
      "c11": "zero_score(): score = 0",
      "c12": "level_three()",
      "q4": "Game: every time lives run out → score = 0, lives = 3, robot back to start. This happens in 3 levels. Which procedure should you make?",
      "c13": "one_pot(): forward 2, water",
      "c14": "go_home()",
      "c15": "water(), go_home()",
      "q5": "Watering robot: forward 2, water, forward 2, water, forward 2, water, go home. Which procedure fits best?",
      "c16": "write it once, use it many times",
      "c17": "to make the program longer",
      "c18": "so the computer needs no instructions",
      "q6": "Why do we turn a part that is used often into a procedure?",
      "c19": "celebrate(name): show name, 'Happy birthday!', horn",
      "c20": "five_friends()",
      "c21": "horn()",
      "q7": "Birthday greeting: show name, show 'Happy birthday!', blow horn. It is used for 5 different friends. A good procedure is…",
      "c22": "repeat 6 times: step()",
      "c23": "step() only",
      "c24": "forward 6, up 6",
      "q8": "Procedure step() = forward 1, up 1. A building needs 6 steps. The shortest program is…",
      "c25": "corner(n): forward n, right, forward n",
      "c26": "corner3() and corner5()",
      "q9": "These two parts are the same except for the number: (forward 3, right, forward 3) and (forward 5, right, forward 5). The most useful procedure is…",
      "c27": "wash_hands()",
      "c28": "eat, play",
      "c29": "sleep()",
      "q10": "Program: wash hands, eat, wash hands, play, wash hands, sleep. Which part fits a procedure?",
      "c30": "make a function discount(price)",
      "c31": "rewrite it on every page",
      "c32": "remove the discount",
      "q11": "A discount calculation is used on 6 pages of an online shop: new_price = price - price * 10 / 100. It is best to…",
      "c33": "repeat 10 times: blink()",
      "c34": "blink() once",
      "c35": "on, off ×10 with no waiting",
      "q12": "Procedure blink(): on, wait 1 second, off, wait 1 second. For 10 blinks, the best program is…"
    }
  },
